 " ",
 "connects two specified input ports."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"f385a12f-cfb0-4cfe-85ee-ead2c0f45c69"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A cap has two inputs and no outputs; it is the ",
 StyleBox["counit", "TI"],
 " / evaluation morphism that pairs a port with its dual."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ab221599-f4ad-4c8e-b736-d6dfe343f364"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Together with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["CupDiagram"]], 
    "paclet:WolframDiagrammaticComputation/ref/CupDiagram", 
    "WolframDiagrammaticComputation Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "6532d470-5aee-4620-a50d-0ad50f91e3a0"],
 " it provides the snake-equation duals that make the category compact-closed."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"4d4c55b8-b992-48af-ba15-566dc94ad4c5"]
}, Open  ]],

